Standard 8x16 VGA Console Font Provenance & License Notice

Upstream Source: Linux Kernel source tree (lib/fonts/font_8x16.c)
Upstream Author / Origin: IBM VGA ROM standard font representation, converted via cpi2fnt.
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Tracked Artifacts:
- kernel/drivers/font.c (contains the 4,096 byte font glyph table extracted from font_8x16.c)
- kernel/drivers/font.h
- third_party/font_8x16.c (reference source file)

